othing to correct. To the driver: your account is accepted. The advisory, the trace and the chat log agree — you told the rider at 07:54 that the PIE was closed by a lorry fire and that you were coming off at Bukit Panjang, and the route matches. The deviation is not material (24.9% and 5.98 km are below the 50% / 8.0 km gates), so the POL-RD-06 driver-profile check is not triggered and no conduct referral arises; even if it were, deviation_flags_90d is 0 over 588 trips. No escalation trigger applies: the trace is unimpaired under POL-RD-07 (100% coverage, 10-second sampling, no gaps), trip identifiers match across all artifacts, and every artifact carries full weight (1.0). The charge stands as billed. Confidence 0.9, resting on the traffic advisory and the GPS trace, both at weight 1.0."
